---
import '../../styles/coaching-portal.css';
import '../../styles/coaching-wallet.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#06142d" />
    <title>Mon compte — Sonny Court Coaching</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="cp-ambient" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="app-layout">
      <aside class="app-sidebar cp-glass">
        <a class="cp-brand" data-back-link href="/coaching/eleve"><span class="cp-mark">S</span><span>COACHING</span></a>
        <div class="role-identity"><span class="role-avatar" data-profile-avatar><span data-profile-initials>SC</span></span><span><small data-profile-role-label>Compte personnel</small><strong data-profile-name>Mon profil</strong></span></div>
        <nav class="app-nav" aria-label="Navigation du compte">
          <p>Navigation</p>
          <a data-back-link href="/coaching/eleve"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg>Retour à mon espace</a>
          <a class="active" href="/coaching/compte"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path></svg>Mon compte</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="sidebar-foot"><strong>Accès sécurisé</strong><small>Ton mot de passe et ta connexion Google sont gérés par Supabase Auth.</small><a href="/coaching/reset-password">Modifier mon mot de passe</a><a href="#" data-logout>Se déconnecter</a></div>
      </aside>

      <main class="app-main">
        <header class="app-topbar"><div><p>Paramètres personnels</p><h1>Mon compte</h1></div><div class="top-actions"><span class="cp-status">Profil sécurisé</span></div></header>
        <div class="app-content">
          <div class="content-wrap">
            <section class="page-intro"><div><p class="cp-eyebrow">Identité et préférences</p><h2>Un espace qui te ressemble, <em>sans complexité.</em></h2><p>Ces informations servent uniquement à personnaliser ton expérience, tes rendez-vous et les communications liées au coaching.</p></div></section>
            <div class="account-shell">
              <aside class="account-identity cp-glass">
                <div class="account-avatar" data-account-avatar><span data-profile-initials>SC</span></div>
                <h2 data-profile-name>Mon profil</h2>
                <p data-profile-email>—</p>
                <span class="account-role" data-profile-role>Compte coaching</span>
                <div class="avatar-upload">
                  <input id="avatar-file" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif" />
                  <label for="avatar-file">Choisir une photo</label>
                  <small>JPG, PNG, WebP ou AVIF · 5 Mo maximum. L’image est stockée dans ton espace Supabase.</small>
                </div>
                <div class="account-security"><div><span>Connexion</span><b data-auth-method>Email + mot de passe</b></div><div><span>Fuseau</span><b data-profile-timezone>Europe/Zurich</b></div><div><span>Visibilité</span><b>Espace coaching uniquement</b></div></div>
              </aside>

              <section class="account-form-card cp-glass">
                <header><p class="cp-eyebrow">Informations personnelles</p><h2>Les détails utiles.</h2><p>Tu peux les modifier à tout moment. Ton adresse email de connexion reste protégée séparément.</p></header>
                <form class="account-form" data-account-form>
                  <input type="hidden" name="avatar_url" />
                  <div class="account-grid">
                    <label><span>Prénom</span><input name="first_name" type="text" maxlength="100" required autocomplete="given-name" /></label>
                    <label><span>Nom</span><input name="last_name" type="text" maxlength="100" autocomplete="family-name" /></label>
                    <label class="account-wide"><span>Email de connexion</span><input name="email" type="email" disabled /></label>
                    <label><span>Téléphone</span><input name="phone" type="tel" maxlength="40" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+41…" /></label>
                    <label><span>Pays</span><select name="country"><option value="">Choisir</option><option value="CH">Suisse</option><option value="FR">France</option><option value="BE">Belgique</option><option value="CA">Canada</option><option value="LU">Luxembourg</option><option value="OTHER">Autre</option></select></label>
                    <label class="account-wide"><span>Fuseau horaire</span><select name="timezone"><option value="Europe/Zurich">Europe/Zurich</option><option value="Europe/Paris">Europe/Paris</option><option value="America/Montreal">America/Montreal</option><option value="America/New_York">America/New_York</option><option value="Indian/Reunion">Indian/Reunion</option></select></label>
                  </div>
                  <p class="account-feedback" data-account-feedback aria-live="polite"></p>
                  <footer><p>La photo n’est envoyée qu’au moment où tu enregistres.</p><button class="cp-button" type="submit">Enregistrer mon profil</button></footer>
                </form>
              </section>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
    <nav class="mobile-nav cp-glass"><a data-back-link href="/coaching/eleve"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg>Retour</a><a class="active" href="/coaching/compte"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path></svg>Compte</a><a href="/coaching/reset-password"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="3"></rect><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"></path></svg>Mot de passe</a><a href="#" data-logout><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M10 17l5-5-5-5"></path><path d="M15 12H3M21 3v18"></path></svg>Sortir</a></nav>
    <script>import '../../scripts/coaching-account.js';</script>
  </body>
</html>
